[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7328.75, "timestamp": "02:02:08", "text": "请大家看一下这里。里面"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7334.03, "timestamp": "02:02:14", "text": "内容来自天空会。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7336.75, "timestamp": "02:02:16", "text": "正如你们许多人可能知道的那样，在某个特定时期"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7340.47, "timestamp": "02:02:20", "text": "突然，天空社团出现在索拉里斯上空。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7342.91, "timestamp": "02:02:22", "text": "塔。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7347.03, "timestamp": "02:02:27", "text": "那一刻，这顿饭充满了高密度的回响能量。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7350.87, "timestamp": "02:02:30", "text": "我看见了一位白神女子。那只是一瞬间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7354.27, "timestamp": "02:02:34", "text": "然而，那道阴影给我们留下了许多谜团。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7356.95, "timestamp": "02:02:36", "text": "这是正确的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7361.35, "timestamp": "02:02:41", "text": "什么是研究小组？它能完成什么工作？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7365.149, "timestamp": "02:02:45", "text": "他为何会出现？套餐是SkyAqua"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7368.47, "timestamp": "02:02:48", "text": "那里进行的研究旨在揭开这些谜团。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7371.43, "timestamp": "02:02:51", "text": "正是为了这个目的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7373.87, "timestamp": "02:02:53", "text": "在系统中注册您的权限并跟随操作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7376.629, "timestamp": "02:02:56", "text": "请。"}]